---

<Layout 
  title="KOA CAFE - کۆوا کافێ | Erbil Boulevard Specialty Venue"
  description="Come visit KOA Cafe at Erbil Boulevard! Where every cup tells a story. Specialty coffee, artisan bites, and immersive spatial design."
>
  <main class="relative bg-koa-oled">

    <!-- HERO SECTION WITH PROCEDURAL THREE.JS & OPALESCENT VIBE -->
    <section id="hero" class="relative min-h-[92vh] flex items-center justify-center px-6 pt-28 pb-16 overflow-hidden">
      <!-- 3D WebGL Background Component -->
      <ThreeHeroScene />

      <!-- Hero Overlay Content -->
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center flex flex-col items-center">
        
        <!-- Live Verified Badge -->
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-koa-amber/40 bg-koa-oled/80 backdrop-blur-md mb-8 shadow-xl shadow-koa-amber/10 animate-fade-in">
          <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-koa-gold animate-pulse"></div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-koa-gold">
            Erbil Boulevard • Naz naz, Erbil
          </span>
          <span class="text-white/40 font-mono">|</span>
          <span class="text-white font-mono text-xs font-semibold">⭐ 4.4 Google Reviews</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Grand Dual Title with Kurdish Accent -->
        <div class="space-y-2 mb-6">
          <h1 class="font-display font-black text-5xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl tracking-tight text-white uppercase leading-[0.9] select-none">
            KOA CAFE
          </h1>
          <p class="font-kurdish font-bold text-2xl sm:text-4xl text-koa-latte/90 tracking-wide mt-2">
            کۆوا کافێ
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Script Accent -->
        <div class="font-serif italic text-xl sm:text-2xl text-koa-amber max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 font-light">
          "Where every cup tells a story ☕️"
        </div>

        <!-- Subtitle Context -->
        <p class="font-normal text-sm sm:text-base text-koa-latte/80 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
          Nestled along the Erbil Boulevard, KOA crafts deliberate specialty coffee, crisp pastries, and an atmosphere calibrated for both deep focus and vibrant evenings.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA Buttons -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto">
          <a 
            href="#bento" 
            class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-koa-amber to-koa-gold text-black font-display font-black text-sm uppercase tracking-wider shadow-lg shadow-koa-amber/25 hover:scale-105 hover:brightness-110 transition-all text-center"
          >
            Explore Curations
          </a>
          <a 
            href="#location" 
            class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md text-white font-display font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all text-center"
          >
            Visit Boulevard
          </a>
          <a 
            href="tel:07502081212"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-4 rounded-full border border-koa-amber/40 text-koa-gold font-mono text-xs tracking-wider hover:bg-koa-amber/10 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>📞</span> 0750 208 1212
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Floating Metadata Chips -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 w-full max-w-3xl text-left font-mono text-xs text-koa-latte/60">
          <div>
            <span class="block text-white font-semibold">21.6K+</span>
            <span>Followers on IG</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-white font-semibold">119+ Reviews</span>
            <span>4.4 Google Score</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-white font-semibold">Lezzoo Partner</span>
            <span>Express Delivery</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-emerald-400 font-semibold">Open Daily</span>
            <span>Until 12:00 Midnight</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Scroll Indicator -->
      <a href="#atmosphere" class="absolute bottom-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-koa-latte/50 hover:text-white transition-colors group">
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase">Scroll Down</span>
        <div class="w-5 h-8 rounded-full border border-white/20 flex items-start justify-center p-1">
          <div class="w-1 h-2 rounded-full bg-koa-amber animate-bounce"></div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </section>

    <!-- ALTERNATING BONE SURFACE: ATMOSPHERE & ROAST PHILOSOPHY -->
    <AtmosphereSurface photos={placeData.photos} />

    <!-- INTERACTIVE 3D BENTO GRID (INSTAGRAM + GOOGLE INTEGRATION) -->
    <BentoGrid posts={instagramData.posts} photos={placeData.photos} />

    <!-- SPECIAL CURATION HIGHLIGHT: SIGNATURE DRINKS & PAIRINGS -->
    <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-koa-oled relative z-10 border-t border-white/10">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-koa-amber block mb-2">Refined Selection</span>
          <h2 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-white">Specially Formulated</h2>
          <p class="font-kurdish text-koa-latte/80 mt-2 text-base">
            قاوەی كوا بۆ تۆ دروست کراوە
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <!-- Item 1 -->
          <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-koa-card border border-white/10 hover:border-koa-amber/40 transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-koa-amber">SPECIALTY BREW</span>
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-koa-amber"></span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-white group-hover:text-koa-gold transition-colors mb-3">
                Koa V60 Single Origin
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-koa-cream/70 leading-relaxed font-light mb-6">
                Meticulously extracted through Japanese Hario drippers to reveal peach blossom, jasmine, and citrus zest undertones.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs">
              <span class="text-koa-latte/60">Dialed in fresh daily</span>
              <span class="text-koa-gold font-bold">Hot / Iced</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Item 2 -->
